n X  biopsy cavity Y Z  representative sections from the breast parenchyma Resident  IVANA DELALLE  MD  PHD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  LEFT BREAST  BIOPSY  HIGH GRADE DUCTAL CARCINOMA WITH AREAS HIGHLY SUSPICIOUS FOR INVASION  O R  Resident  CHIN LEE WU  MD  PhD O R  Diagnosis by  Joseph Misdraji  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Paula Gail O connor  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST  RIGHT  FINAL MEDIAL    EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART C  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART D  BREAST  RIGHT  SUPERIOR MARGIN    EXCISIONAL BIOPS PART E  BREAST  LEFT   RE EXCISION PART F  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLA   EXCISION PART G  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLA  ADDITIONAL    EXCISION   report_end  , Unchecked.
