 T  McKee MD Signed On  16 REMOVED_MONTH 02 at 14 42 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast tumor   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 1cm lumpectomy specimen with a short stitch indicating inferior  and a long stitch indicating lateral  and bow tie indicating cephalad  The specimen is inked as follows  anterior black  posterior blue  and superior orange  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm spiculated  hard mass  1 0cm from the superior margin  0 8cm from the inferior margin  1 0cm from the anterior margin  0 7cm from the posterior margin  2 8cm from the medial margin  and 2 5cm from the lateral margin  The remainder of the specimen is fibrofatty and has no masses or lesions identified  SECTION CODE  A  Mass with anterior and posterior margins  B C  Mass with anterior and posterior margins  D  Mass with superior and inferior margins  E H  Representative sections of unremarkable breast tissue  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right primary sentinel node  631  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 3cm lymph node bisected and submitted entirely in cassette R  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right secondary sentinel  is a REMOVED_DATE x 1 x 0 8cm lymph node bisected and submitted entirely in cassette S  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left primary sentinel node  617  is a 2 x REMOVED_DATE x 1cm lymph node bisected and submitted entirely in cassette T  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left secondary sentinel node  62  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm lymph node entirely submitted in cassette U  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 5 0cm portion