ction of tissue away from the mass  including the inferior margin towards the lateral end of the specimen Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and   2 stitch on deep medial margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm portion of breast tissue which is externally unremarkable  The specimen is oriented by a stitch marking the deep medial aspect of the specimen  The specimen is inked as follows  black deep  posterior   blue superficial  anterior   It is serially sectioned to reveal unremarkable fibrofatty breast tissue  The specimen was submitted entirely as follows  N  Lateral end of the specimen en face O  Medial end of the specimen en face P  Representative sections from the lateral aspect of the specimen including the superior margin Q  Representative sections of the specimen including the inferior margin  in the lateral aspect of the specimen R  Section from the central  with respect to medial to lateral ends  portion of specimen including superior margin S  Section from the central portion of the specimen including the inferior margin T  Section of the specimen including the inferior margin  towards the medial end of the specimen U  Section of the specimen including the superior margin  towards the medial end of the specimen Resident  JOHN BRANDA  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Susan E Briggs  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST  RIGHT  DEEP MARGIN    EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Unchecked.
